{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "kjv-hebrews-003",
  "collection": "kjv-bible",
  "document_type": "bible_chapter",
  "number": 3,
  "title": "Hebrews 3",
  "display_title": "Hebrews 3",
  "translation": "King James Version",
  "translationCode": "KJV",
  "bookId": "hebrews",
  "book": "Hebrews",
  "bookName": "Hebrews",
  "bookOrder": 58,
  "testament": "new",
  "chapter": 3,
  "sortOrder": 58003,
  "verseCount": 19,
  "aliases": [
    "Heb",
    "He"
  ],
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "verse-001",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 1,
      "verseId": "kjv:hebrews:3:1",
      "numberLabel": "1",
      "text": "Wherefore, holy brethren, partakers of the heavenly calling, consider the Apostle and High Priest of our profession, Christ Jesus;",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Hebrews 3:1",
        "verseKey": "kjv:hebrews:3:1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-002",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 2,
      "verseId": "kjv:hebrews:3:2",
      "numberLabel": "2",
      "text": "Who was faithful to him that appointed him, as also Moses was faithful in all his house.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Hebrews 3:2",
        "verseKey": "kjv:hebrews:3:2"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-003",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 3,
      "verseId": "kjv:hebrews:3:3",
      "numberLabel": "3",
      "text": "For this man was counted worthy of more glory than Moses, inasmuch as he who hath builded the house hath more honour than the house.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Hebrews 3:3",
        "verseKey": "kjv:hebrews:3:3"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-004",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 4,
      "verseId": "kjv:hebrews:3:4",
      "numberLabel": "4",
      "text": "For every house is builded by some man; but he that built all things is God.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Hebrews 3:4",
        "verseKey": "kjv:hebrews:3:4"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-005",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 5,
      "verseId": "kjv:hebrews:3:5",
      "numberLabel": "5",
      "text": "And Moses verily was faithful in all his house, as a servant, for a testimony of those things which were to be spoken after;",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Hebrews 3:5",
        "verseKey": "kjv:hebrews:3:5"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-006",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 6,
      "verseId": "kjv:hebrews:3:6",
      "numberLabel": "6",
      "text": "But Christ as a son over his own house; whose house are we, if we hold fast the confidence and the rejoicing of the hope firm unto the end.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Hebrews 3:6",
        "verseKey": "kjv:hebrews:3:6"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-007",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 7,
      "verseId": "kjv:hebrews:3:7",
      "numberLabel": "7",
      "text": "Wherefore (as the Holy Ghost saith, To day if ye will hear his voice,",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Hebrews 3:7",
        "verseKey": "kjv:hebrews:3:7"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-008",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 8,
      "verseId": "kjv:hebrews:3:8",
      "numberLabel": "8",
      "text": "Harden not your hearts, as in the provocation, in the day of temptation in the wilderness:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Hebrews 3:8",
        "verseKey": "kjv:hebrews:3:8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-009",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 9,
      "verseId": "kjv:hebrews:3:9",
      "numberLabel": "9",
      "text": "When your fathers tempted me, proved me, and saw my works forty years.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Hebrews 3:9",
        "verseKey": "kjv:hebrews:3:9"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-010",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 10,
      "verseId": "kjv:hebrews:3:10",
      "numberLabel": "10",
      "text": "Wherefore I was grieved with that generation, and said, They do alway err in their heart; and they have not known my ways.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Hebrews 3:10",
        "verseKey": "kjv:hebrews:3:10"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-011",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 11,
      "verseId": "kjv:hebrews:3:11",
      "numberLabel": "11",
      "text": "So I sware in my wrath, They shall not enter into my rest.)",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Hebrews 3:11",
        "verseKey": "kjv:hebrews:3:11"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-012",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 12,
      "verseId": "kjv:hebrews:3:12",
      "numberLabel": "12",
      "text": "Take heed, brethren, lest there be in any of you an evil heart of unbelief, in departing from the living God.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Hebrews 3:12",
        "verseKey": "kjv:hebrews:3:12"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-013",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 13,
      "verseId": "kjv:hebrews:3:13",
      "numberLabel": "13",
      "text": "But exhort one another daily, while it is called To day; lest any of you be hardened through the deceitfulness of sin.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Hebrews 3:13",
        "verseKey": "kjv:hebrews:3:13"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-014",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 14,
      "verseId": "kjv:hebrews:3:14",
      "numberLabel": "14",
      "text": "For we are made partakers of Christ, if we hold the beginning of our confidence stedfast unto the end;",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Hebrews 3:14",
        "verseKey": "kjv:hebrews:3:14"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-015",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 15,
      "verseId": "kjv:hebrews:3:15",
      "numberLabel": "15",
      "text": "While it is said, To day if ye will hear his voice, harden not your hearts, as in the provocation.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Hebrews 3:15",
        "verseKey": "kjv:hebrews:3:15"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-016",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 16,
      "verseId": "kjv:hebrews:3:16",
      "numberLabel": "16",
      "text": "For some, when they had heard, did provoke: howbeit not all that came out of Egypt by Moses.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Hebrews 3:16",
        "verseKey": "kjv:hebrews:3:16"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-017",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 17,
      "verseId": "kjv:hebrews:3:17",
      "numberLabel": "17",
      "text": "But with whom was he grieved forty years? was it not with them that had sinned, whose carcases fell in the wilderness?",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Hebrews 3:17",
        "verseKey": "kjv:hebrews:3:17"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-018",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 18,
      "verseId": "kjv:hebrews:3:18",
      "numberLabel": "18",
      "text": "And to whom sware he that they should not enter into his rest, but to them that believed not?",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Hebrews 3:18",
        "verseKey": "kjv:hebrews:3:18"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-019",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 19,
      "verseId": "kjv:hebrews:3:19",
      "numberLabel": "19",
      "text": "So we see that they could not enter in because of unbelief.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Hebrews 3:19",
        "verseKey": "kjv:hebrews:3:19"
      }
    }
  ],
  "source": {
